{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 28, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived, I was struck by the country's unique blend of traditional and modern culture. I spent my days exploring the bustling streets of Tokyo, marveling at the towering skyscrapers and neon lights that seemed to stretch on forever.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market, where I sampled some of the freshest sushi I've ever had. I was also able to witness the daily tuna auction, a fascinating and chaotic spectacle that was both thrilling and intimidating.\n\nBeyond the city, I had the opportunity to experience Japan's stunning natural beauty. I visited the serene gardens and temples of Kyoto, where I was able to relax and unwind in a tranquil atmosphere. The cherry blossoms were in full bloom, adding a touch of magic to the already breathtaking scenery.\n\nThroughout my journey, I was struck by the kindness and hospitality of the Japanese people. From the friendly locals who offered me directions and recommendations, to the chefs who served me delicious meals, I felt welcomed and at home.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an incredible adventure that left me with unforgettable memories and a deep appreciation for this fascinating country. I'm already planning my next trip back, and I'm excited to explore more of what Japan has to offer.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.47522157430648804}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.00531415268778801}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.271740287251305e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -8.22540732769994e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.25465595722198486}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5827164649963379}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0003483880718704313}, {"token"